<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 6,500 MT resulted from increases for South Korea (8,000 MT, reflects 5,000 new sales, 3,000 destination changes), Guatemala (1,200 MT), and Jamaica (300 MT) being partially offset by reductions for unknown destinations (3,000 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 21,800 MT were to China (21,000 MT) and Mexico (700 MT).</p>
</text>
